sequenceDiagram
    participant 用户
    participant PC
    participant Navigation2 as navigation2
    participant TB3 as Turtlebot3
    participant Listener as robot_position_listener
    participant RTABMAP as rtabmap
    participant RVIZ2 as rviz2

    用户->>PC: 发起导航请求
    PC->>Navigation2: 发送目标位置
    Navigation2->>TB3: 发布/cmd_vel控制指令
    TB3-->>Navigation2: 里程计反馈
    Listener-->>Navigation2: 位置反馈
    RTABMAP-->>Navigation2: 定位反馈
    Navigation2->>RVIZ2: 发布导航状态
    RVIZ2-->>用户: 可视化导航过程


